sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Web UI (Suggestions / Actions)
    participant API as Backend API
    participant SS as Suggestion Service
    participant EX as Action Executor
    participant AWS as AWS APIs
    participant MON as Monitor Service
    participant DB as Database

    U->>UI: Open /suggestions
    UI->>API: GET /suggestions?status=open
    API->>DB: Query open suggestions
    DB-->>API: Suggestions list
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (suggestions)
    UI-->>U: Show table (savings, confidence, reason)

    alt Apply suggestion
        U->>UI: Click "Apply"
        UI-->>U: Show confirmation modal (current vs recommended, rollback plan)
        U->>UI: Click "Apply & Monitor"
        UI->>API: POST /suggestions/{id}/apply
        API->>SS: validate(id, status=Open)
        SS->>DB: Snapshot previous config + create Action (Pending)
        opt Scheduled (maintenance window)
            SS->>DB: Set status = Scheduled, runAt
            Note over SS,EX: Executor waits until runAt
        end
        SS->>EX: execute(action)
        EX->>AWS: Apply change (e.g. stop → resize → start)
        alt Success
            AWS-->>EX: OK
            EX->>DB: Action = Applied, Suggestion = Applied
            EX->>MON: Start monitoring (72h, thresholds)
            API-->>UI: 200 OK (Applied · monitoring)
            UI-->>U: Toast "Applied, monitoring 72h"
        else Failure
            AWS-->>EX: Error
            EX->>DB: Action = Failed (error logged)
            API-->>UI: 500 / Failed
            UI-->>U: Show "Failed" with Retry
        end

    else Reject (Dismiss) suggestion
        U->>UI: Click "Dismiss"
        UI-->>U: Show dismiss popover (reason)
        U->>UI: Select reason, confirm
        UI->>API: POST /suggestions/{id}/dismiss {reason}
        API->>SS: dismiss(id, reason)
        SS->>DB: Suggestion = Dismissed, store reason (feedback)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>U: Row shows "Dismissed" + Restore link

    else Revert (Roll back) applied change
        alt Manual rollback
            U->>UI: Actions page → "Roll back"
            UI->>API: POST /actions/{id}/rollback
            API->>EX: rollback(action)
        else Automatic rollback
            MON->>AWS: Poll metrics (CloudWatch)
            AWS-->>MON: Threshold breached (e.g. CPU > 80% for 15m)
            MON->>EX: rollback(action)
        end
        EX->>DB: Load previous config snapshot
        DB-->>EX: Previous config
        EX->>AWS: Restore previous config
        AWS-->>EX: OK
        EX->>MON: Stop monitoring
        EX->>DB: Action = Rolled back, Suggestion = "Not accurate" (re-evaluate)
        API-->>UI: Status update
        UI-->>U: Row shows "Rolled back" + Details timeline
    end
